@q 10:104-107

@src1 10:12
@one U.P. Lower Sub. (Spl.) (Pre) 2008
'National social assistance programme' is aimed at
@ans Old age pension to very poor
@end

The **National Social Assistance Programme** (**15 August 1995**) has old-age, widow and disability pensions, the **National Family Benefit Scheme** and **Annapurna** (free grain to old people without pension). The **Minimum Needs Programme** (Fifth Plan) means investing in people: elementary education, rural health, water, roads, housing and **urban slum improvement**, not social forestry.

